{"id":"arrus","name":"Arrus","type":"character","aliases":["slick"],"description":"A cold-hearted, runt viashino Gruul tattoo artist of the Ghor Clan who is cast out after his ink burns warriors, learns to make healing ink from Baas Radley, uncovers Selesnya's drain on the Rubblebelt and finds his Rage.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2019-01-30","last_seen":"2019-01-30","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e0","era":null,"summary":"Arrus gathers ingredients for his magical tattoo ink, tampering with the recipe because the maaka scat is poor.","participants":["arrus"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"minor","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"so I desperately add more scat to the mix until finally the ink brightens.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=so%20I%20desperately%20add,finally%20the%20ink%20brightens.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=so%20I%20desperately%20add,finally%20the%20ink%20brightens.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}