news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=I%20think%20he%27s%20going,Thar%20for%20clan%20chieftain%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e3","era":null,"summary":"Dryzek tells Arrus that Rage speaks differently to different people, hinting he knows Arrus's heart is cold, and Arrus starts tattooing his arm.","participants":["dryzek","arrus"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"I know Rage when I see it, and that ain't it. But it'll find you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=I%20know%20Rage%20when,But%20it%27ll%20find%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=I%20know%20Rage%20when,But%20it%27ll%20find%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e5","era":null,"summary":"The ink Arrus made bursts into flame on Jiri, Dryzek and other warriors, and Ruric and Thar cast Arrus out of the clan.","participants":["arrus","ruric-and-thar","jiri","dryzek"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":53,"quote":"Your services are no longer needed here,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=Your%20services%20are%20no%20longer%20needed%20here%2C","citation":{"s