unsung-2019-01-30-e9","era":null,"summary":"Arrus recognizes the ogre as Baas Radley, the shaman who collapsed the Jezeru dams.","participants":["arrus","baas-radley"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":90,"quote":"Wait. You're Baas Radley. The shaman who collapsed the Jezeru dams?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=Wait.%20You%27re%20Baas%20Radley.,collapsed%20the%20Jezeru%20dams%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=Wait.%20You%27re%20Baas%20Radley.,collapsed%20the%20Jezeru%20dams%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e10","era":null,"summary":"Baas teaches Arrus to face down a charging battleboar herd and offers to send him to Burning Tree Clan and teach him her ink recipe.","participants":["baas-radley","arrus"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":115,"quote":"You're too good to toss to the Wilds.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=You%27re%20too%20good%20to%20toss%20to%20the%20Wilds.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=You%27re%20too%20good%20to%20toss%20to%20the%20Wilds.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e12","era":null,"summary":"Arrus discovers that trees on the Selesnyan border are only five years old, planted as a fast-grown barrier that leeches magic from the Rubblebelt.","participants":["arrus","selesnya-conclave","baas-radley"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":137,"quote":"Selesnya had planted thousands and thousands of saplings, and then accelerated their growth until they had the perfect impenetrable barrier.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=Selesnya%20had%20planted%20thousands,the%20perfect%20impenetrable%20barrier.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Rage of the Unsung","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-30","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/rage-unsung-2019-01-30#:~:text=Selesnya%20had%20planted%20thousands,the%20perfect%20impenetrable%20barrier.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Rage of the Unsung\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 30 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"rage-unsung-2019-01-30-e13","era":null,"summary":"Arrus challenges Ruric and Thar for clan chieftain and is beaten, repeatedly defying them.","participants":["arrus","ruric-and-thar","jiri"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/rage-unsung-2019-01-30","order":609,"story_date":"2019-01-30","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":145,"quote":"Ruric pounds his huge fist on the top of my head, and I crumple to the ground",